身体侧身，左手掀起旗袍露出臀部，右手轻搭栏杆，头部微侧，眼神慵懒凝视镜头。", 0, 1000, ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 3744, "label": "提示词", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_index"}, "name": "start_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "起始索引"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_rows"}, "name": "max_rows", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "最大行数"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptLine", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [307.4482116699219, 534.3571166992188], "pos": [-240.20150756835938, 1398.8177490234375], "id": 76, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "8ecc929cd41cf0f7ef6fcc45d4bbc5729c6f287f", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"start_index": true, "max_rows": true, "prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptLine"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [5789], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}], "size": [320.265380859375, 58], "pos": [-1342.6129150390625, 1214.367431640625], "widgets_values": [1920], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 104, "type": "Int", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Int"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [367.10552978515625, 682], "pos": [96.49413299560547, 1240.494873046875], "widgets_values": ["Next Scene: 室内，低光环境，主角身穿黑色服饰，手握剑，慢推镜头展示剑锋寒光。背景有古风木制家具，光影交错，紧张气氛浓烈。", "Next Scene: 室内中景，主角与对手交锋，剑光交错，动作迅猛。镜头侧移，展示两人身形与剑法对决，背景木梁与烛光晃动。", "Next Scene: 室内特写，主角剑锋直指对手眼前，表情冷峻。慢推镜头进一步强调剑与人物的紧张关系，背景模糊但古风元素依然清晰。", "Next Scene: 室内俯拍，主角跃起劈下，对手闪避退后。镜头快速移动跟随动作，地板裂纹与飞溅的木屑增强战斗激烈感。", "Next Scene: 室内远景，战斗从房间延伸至庭院，镜头拉远展示两人从木门冲出，背景古风庭院与树影形成空间层次。", "Next Scene: 室外中景，主角脚踩栏杆飞跃至庭院中央，剑光划破夜空。镜头环绕跟随其动作，营造凌厉气势。", "Next Scene: 室外特写，主角脚步轻点地面，剑刃指向对手，眼神锐利。背景模糊，庭院灯笼光影隐约闪烁。", "Next Scene: 室外俯拍，主角快速闪身绕到对手身后，剑锋贴近。镜头快速切换，展现高超身法与紧张节奏。", "Next Scene: 室外远景，主角与对手在庭院中激烈交战，镜头慢推拉远，展示庭院全景与两人身影。灯光与影子交织，空间感强烈。", "Next Scene: 室外侧移镜头，主角剑招凌厉，动作连贯，镜头跟随剑光移动，呈现流畅的战斗场面。背景树影随风摇曳。", "Next Scene: 室外低角度，主角跃起挥剑，动作定格在空中，镜头慢推展示其威风凛凛的姿态，背景天空与庭院形成对比。", "Next Scene: 室外特写，主角剑尖抵住对手，表情冷峻而坚定。镜头缓慢推近，烘托紧张气氛，背景灯笼光影若隐若现。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 3064, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 99, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [9664], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400.63873291015625, 120.31084442138672], "pos": [-680.3973999023438, 1231.84423828125], "widgets_values": ["这是一部关于傲雪星辰的武侠电影场景镜头，参考图片，帮我生成12张激烈战斗的分镜图片，从室内到室外，不同运镜和角度，不同的视角和景别"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 103, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [2000, 2636], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [345.7674865722656, 583.1331176757812], "pos": [-1356.2481689453125, 577.8928833007812], "widgets_values": ["275cb7764a6c1339972e5a730dda28931bc0b09422b30d069327aff3d6d46817.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 74, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.64", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadI